==Problem description==
No Power and no signs of life
[[File:Placeholder image.jpg|thumb|Example image (Figure 1) -- No image yet. Help expand this page by uploading it!]]
==Symptoms==

*No Power 
*Not responsive

==Solution==

* Check Power Cable
* Ensure 12v Is Coming From Power Supply To Mainboard
* Replace HDMI Encoder (Currently Not Available to Purchase)
* Check For Shorts On 12v, 5v, 3.3v, 1.8v, 1.1v